{"d":"Appartement à louer idéalement placé. Prix 3 300 TND. 3 chambres, 2 salles de bains, surface 500 m². Moins de 30 ans. Revêtement: Marbre. Vue exceptionnelle sur les montagnes, fenêtres avec double vitrage, chauffage central et porte blindée.\nCet appartement est à louer à La Marsa. Les extérieurs se composent d'un jardin et d'une terrasse. Climatisation.\nSoyez le premier à visiter cet appartement à louer. Cuisine équipée. Antenne parabolique. Salon contemporain.","ph":["https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_0_83668815.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_1_68830054.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_2_68830055.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_3_68830056.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_4_83668816.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_5_83668817.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_6_83668818.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_7_83668819.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_8_83668820.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_9_83668821.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_10_83668822.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_11_83668823.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_12_83668824.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_13_83668825.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_14_83668826.jpeg","https://www.mubawab-media.com/ad/7/865/354F/h/photo_15_83668827.jpeg"]}